lass='sig'>+0.29\u00b0F per decade</strong> (95% range +0.23 to +0.35), about +3.5\u00b0F since 1905.","t_mon":"Lows rose in 9 of 12 months. Highs rose in 11 of 12 months.","t_rain":"Providence has gotten wetter","p_rain":"Providence's yearly precipitation has risen <strong class='sig'>+1.22 inches per decade</strong> (95% range +0.88 to +1.56), about +14.6 inches since 1905. The 1991\u20132020 normal is 47.7 inches a year. The wettest year was 1983 (67.52 in); the driest, 1965 (25.44 in).","show_snow":true,"sig_bars":{"lo":true,"hi":false},"t_year":"2026 so far: 6 daily record highs, no daily record lows"}}